    <string name="legal_developer_heading">ಅಭಿವೃದ್ಧಿಗಾರ · Developer</string>
    <string name="legal_developer_body">MadhvaNidhi is developed and published by Human Centric Works.\nWebsite: https://hcworks.in\nPlace: Hospet (Hosapete), Karnataka, India.\nPackage: in.hcworks.madhvanidhi\n\nContact for rights, corrections, or takedown requests via the website contact channels.\n\nಮಾಧ್ವನಿಧಿ ಅಭಿವೃದ್ಧಿ: Human Centric Works · hcworks.in · ಹೊಸಪೇಟೆ.</string>
    <string name="legal_privacy_heading">ಗೌಪ್ಯತೆ · Privacy</string>
    <string name="legal_privacy_body">What we store on your device\n• Sadhak profile (name, gotra, rashi, nakshatra, birth details, diksha flags)\n• Practice logs, japa targets, UI preferences, local backups you create\n• Catalogue reading position where applicable\n\nHow it is protected\n• Profile/vault data stays on-device; portable backups use a passphrase (AES-GCM)\n• android:allowBackup is disabled for the app data tree\n• No MadhvaNidhi account sign-in; no cloud sync of the user vault\n\nNetwork use\n• Internet permission is used for optional live Panchanga tradition feeds when you select a tradition that publishes daily data and the device is online\n• If live data is unavailable, the app falls back to local calculation and labels it clearly\n• No advertising SDKs; we do not sell personal data\n\nYour choices\n• Clear app data / uninstall to remove local vault content\n• Create or restore passphrase-protected backup files from the Backup tab\n\nThis declaration describes current debug/product behaviour. Material changes will be reflected here.</string>
    <string name="legal_license_heading">ಪರವಾನಗಿ · Licences &amp; content</string>
    <string name="legal_license_body">Application\n• MadhvaNidhi app code, branding, and packaging © Human Centric Works. All rights reserved unless a file states otherwise.\n\nIBM Carbon\n• UI follows IBM Carbon Design System tokens/components. Selected Carbon icons are Apache License 2.0 — see assets/licenses/carbon-icons.txt.\n\nHaridasa padagalu\n• Underlying classical compositions are public-domain literary works.\n• Kannada Wikisource transcriptions under madhwa/texts/haridasa/ are CC BY-SA 4.0 (attribution: Kannada Wikisource contributors). Adaptations of those pages remain under CC BY-SA 4.0 — see assets/licenses/haridasa-wikisource.txt and docs/haridasa-import-manifest.csv.\n\nOther texts\n• Stotra, mantra, namavali, and paddhati bodies retain source notes in docs/CATALOGUE_AUDIT.md. Do not assume one licence for the whole library.\n\nThird-party sites\n• MadhvaNidhi is not affiliated with Saaranga Infotech LLP, sampada.net, or other external lyric portals. Those sites were discovery references only; their pages were not scraped into the APK.\n\nFull machine-readable notice: assets/licenses/NOTICE.txt</string>
    <string name="legal_footer_hint">ವಿವರಗಳು Legal ಟ್ಯಾಬ್‌ನಲ್ಲಿ · Full notices under Legal</string>
